    "title": "Canvas Parent",
    "description": "Traditionally, parents seeking information about their students' progress had to sift through assignment planners, email instructors, or wait for report cards. But the wait is over! Canvas Parent is designed to provide visibility into your child's education at a glance. Canvas Parent allows parents to:\r\n\r\n\u2022 View assignment descriptions and due dates\r\n\u2022 Set reminders for assignments\r\n\u2022 View assignment grades\r\n\u2022 View course grades\r\n\u2022 Set grade alerts\r\n\u2022 View course announcements\r\n\r\nImportant: This mobile app is only usable by parents whose children attend schools that have enabled Canvas Parent.",
